<title>USA: Noranda Aluminum cuts US tag to 83 cents.</title>
<headline>Noranda Aluminum cuts US tag to 83 cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noranda Aluminum Inc, part of Canada's Noranda Inc, said its June U.S. list price for ingot is 83 cents per pound, down one cent from 84 cents in May.</p>
<p>June's billet price was also cut one cent to 93 cents.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
